                                                "sense_id": "64fdd303-f0c6-3602-9f09-50986dfb38b7",
                                                "text": "Grace bent to her oars with a springing verve and force which made the tubby little boat draw towards the shore, the whispering lapse of water gliding under its sides all the while."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bdfa9bd-7b75-4fbe-9da7-48279eacd75d",
                                                "sense_id": "64fdd303-f0c6-3602-9f09-50986dfb38b7",
